      "text": "has an outward radial acceleration",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Body moves with constant speed it means that tangential acceleration $\\mathrm{a}_{\\mathrm{T}}=0 \\& \\mathrm{conly}$ centripetal acceleration $\\mathrm{a}_{\\mathrm{C}}$ exists whose direction is always towards the centre or inward (along the radius of the circle)."
